         S_BASE % 'Candy (metal 200, roughness 15, coat 16)' + ' Set BASE COLOR to Use solid color and choose a deep colour for the hero. Candy is the glossy one.',
         'Add a second zone for the neighbouring area. Choose Matte from the same shelf (metal 0, roughness 200, coat 160) with the opposite colour. Drag the hero zone above the matte zone in the left column so it wins where they meet.',
